<sheets>
<sheet>
<plain>
<text x="5.08" y="17.78" size="1.27" layer="97" font="vector">https://en.trxcom.net/Products_details/386.html
Here is says there are NO MAGNETICS inside TRJE101AGNL </text>
<text x="5.08" y="5.08" size="1.27" layer="97" font="vector">What's wrong
1) Poorly drawn Schematic 
2) TXD+/TXD- on SFP connector side must be swapped
3) Ethernet connector has no embedded magnetics. Need another connector</text>
</plain>
